pace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; Margin: 0; padding: 0; background-position: center top; background-repeat: repeat; height: 100%; width: 100%; background-color: #FFFFFF;\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"esd-email-paddings\" valign=\"top\" style=\"Margin: 0; padding: 0;\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"es-content esd-header-popover\" align=\"center\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; table-layout: fixed!important; width: 100%!important; max-width: 600px!important;\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"esd-stripe\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"Margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #ffffff;\"><table bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" class=\"es-content-body\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"650\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; background-color: transparent; max-width: 600px!important; width: 100%!important;\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"esd-structure\" align=\"left\" style=\"Margin: 0; padding: 0;\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; max-width: 600px!important; width: 100%!important;\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"650\" class=\"esd-container-frame\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"Margin: 0; padding: 0;\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; max-width: 600px!important; width: 100%!important;\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"esd-block-html\" style=\"Margin: 0; padding: 0;\"><!--\n  Bio-Check Opt-In Intro &middot; MAIL-VERSION mit AC-CONFIRMLINK\n  ============================================================\n  Verwendung: In der DOI-Best&auml;tigungs-Mail von AC.\n  AC ersetzt %CONFIRMLINK% beim Versand mit dem pers&ouml;nlichen\n  Best&auml;tigungs-Link des Subscribers.\n\n  &#9888;&#65039; Falls dein AC einen anderen Tag-Namen nutzt:\n     Andere Schreibweisen k&ouml;nnen sein:\n     - %CONFIRMLINK%\n     - %CONFIRM_LINK%\n     - %CONFIRM%\n     - {{ confirm_link }}\n     Im AC-Editor unter &bdquo;Personalize\" / &bdquo;Personalisieren\" findest du\n     den richtigen Tag (oben rechts in der Mail-Bearbeitung).\n\n  Tables + Solid-Color + Inline-Styles f&uuml;r Mail-Client-Kompat.\n--><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; max-width: 600px; width: auto!important; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #12828c; border-radius: 18px;\"><tbody><tr><td bgcolor=\"#12828c\" style=\"Margin: 0; padding: 36px 32px; background-color: #12828c; text-align: center; border-radius: 18px;\"><!-- Eyebrow Badge --><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; max-width: 600px!important; width: auto!important; margin: 0 auto 22px;\"><tbody><tr><td bgcolor=\"#dc822e\" style=\"Margin: 0; padding: 8px 18px; background-color: #dc822e; border-radius: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#ffffff;\">\n              &#127807; GRATIS · 3 MINUTEN · KI-BOT\n            </span></td></tr></tbody></table><!-- Headline --><h2 style=\"Margin: 0; font-family: Georgia,serif; line-height: 1.2; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; color: #f1ecdd; font-size: 32px; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 14px 0;\">\n        Deine Bio. Endlich klar.\n      </h2><!-- Sub-Headline --><p style=\"Margin: 0; -ms-text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-text-size-adjust: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; font-family: Georgia,serif; line-height: 1.55; color: #f1ecdd; font-size: 17px; font-style: italic; margin: 0 0 28px 0; opacity: 0.9;\">\n        Mein KI-Bot baut dir in drei Minuten<br>\n        eine Bio, die nicht mehr nach Krimskrams aussieht —<br>\n        sondern wie ein Schaufenster, in das man reingeht.\n      </p><!-- Trenn-Linie --><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; max-width: 600px!important; width: auto!important; margin: 0 auto 28px;\"><tbody><tr><td bgcolor=\"#dc822e\" style=\"Margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #dc822e; width: 60px; height: 3px; font-size: 0; line-height: 0; border-radius: 2px;\"> </td></tr></tbody></table><!-- Bullet-Liste --><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; max-width: 420px; width: auto!important; margin: 0 auto 28px; text-align: left;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"Margin: 0; padding: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#dc822e;font-weight:bold;font-size:18px;margin-right:10px;\">✓</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#f1ecdd;\">\n              Deinen <strong>Experten-Satz</strong> in 3 Varianten\n            </span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"Margin: 0; padding: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#dc822e;font-weight:bold;font-size:18px;margin-right:10px;\">✓</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#f1ecdd;\"><strong>5 fertige Bio-Vorschläge</strong>, copy-paste-ready\n            </span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"Margin: 0; padding: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#dc822e;font-weight:bold;font-size:18px;margin-right:10px;\">✓</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#f1ecdd;\"><strong>3 Pinned-Posts-Ideen</strong> — die Schuhe in deinem Schaufenster\n            </span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"Margin: 0; padding: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#dc822e;font-weight:bold;font-size:18px;margin-right:10px;\">✓</span><span style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#f1ecdd;\"><strong>Alles als PDF</strong> — landet in deiner Mailbox\n            </span></td></tr></tbody></table><!-- Trust-Text vor Button --><p style=\"Margin: 0; -ms-text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-text-size-adjust: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; line-height: 150%; color: #f1ecdd; font-size: 14px; opacity: 0.85; margin: 0 0 6px 0; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">\n        Bestätige unten kurz deine E-Mail —<br>\n        dann landet der Bot-Link sofort bei dir\n      </p><!-- Pfeil --><p style=\"Margin: 0; -ms-text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-text-size-adjust: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; font-family: 'source sans pro', 'helvetica neue', helvetica, arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1; color: #dc822e; font-size: 28px; margin: 6px 0 18px 0;\">⬇</p><!-- ============================================================\n           BEST&Auml;TIGUNGS-BUTTON mit AC-CONFIRMLINK-Tag\n           %CONFIRMLINK% wird beim Versand automatisch durch den\n           pers&ouml;nlichen Best&auml;tigungs-Link des Subscribers ersetzt.\n           ============================================================ --><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; max-width: 600px!important; width: auto!important; margin: 0 auto 14px;\"><tbody><tr><td bgcolor=\"#dc822e\" style=\"Margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #dc822e; border-radius: 50px;\"><a href=\"%CONFIRMLINK%\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"-ms-text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-text-size-adjust: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; text-decoration: none; color: #ffffff; font-size: 17px; display: inline-block; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0.5px; padding: 18px 38px; border-radius: 50px;\">\n              Ja, ich bestätige meine E-Mail &#127807;\n            </a></td></tr></tbody></table><!-- Falls der Button nicht klickbar --><p style=\"Margin: 0; -ms-text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-text-size-adjust: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; font-family: Arial,sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #f1ecdd; font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.6; margin: 8px 0 0 0;\">\n        Falls der Button nicht funktioniert, kopier diesen Link in deinen Browser:<br><a href=\"%CONFIRMLINK%\" style=\"-ms-text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-text-size-adjust: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; text-decoration: underline; color: #f1ecdd; font-size: 16px!important; word-break: break-all;\">%CONFIRMLINK%</a></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"es-content esd-footer-popover\" align=\"center\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; table-layout: fixed!important; width: 100%!important; max-width: 600px!important;\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"esd-stripe\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"Margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #ffffff;\"><table bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" class=\"es-content-body\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"650\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; background-color: transparent; max-width: 600px!important; width: 100%!important;\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"esd-structure\" align=\"left\" style=\"Margin: 0; padding: 0;\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; max-width: 600px!important; width: 100%!important;\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"650\" class=\"esd-container-frame\" align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"Margin: 0; padding: 0;\"><table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; max-width: 600px!important; width: 100%!important;\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\" class=\"esd-block-text es-p40t es-p40b\" style=\"Margin: 0; padding: 0 0 40px 0;\"><p style=\"Margin: 0; -ms-text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-text-size-adjust: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; font-family: helvetica, 'helvetica neue', arial, verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 150%; color: #0c1c30; font-size: 12px;\"><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table><table class=\"es-footer ac-footer\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; table-layout: fixed!important; width: 100%!important; background-color: transparent; background-position: center top; background-repeat: repeat; max-width: 600px!important;\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"center\" class=\"es-footer-body\" style=\"Margin: 0; padding: 20px 0 20px 0; background-color: transparent; display: block!important; width: 100%!important; background: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 12px; color: inherit;\"><p style=\"Margin: 0; -ms-text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-text-size-adjust: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; font-family: inherit; line-height: 150%; color: inherit; font-size: inherit; display: block!important; width: 100%!important;\">Gesendet an: %EMAIL%<br><br><a style=\"-ms-text-size-adjust: none; -webkit-text-size-adjust: none; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; text-decoration: underline; color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-weight: inherit;\" href=\"%UNSUBSCRIBELINK%\" target=\"_blank\">Abbestellen</a><br><br><span class=\"perstag_address\" style=\"color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: inherit; color: inherit;\">%SENDER-INFO-SINGLELINE%</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></body></html>\n",
 "text": " GRATIS · 3 MINUTEN · KI-BOT \n\n**Deine Bio. Endlich klar.** Mein KI-Bot baut dir in drei Minuten\neine Bio, die nicht mehr nach Krimskrams aussieht —\nsondern wie ein Schaufenster, in das man reingeht. \n\n \n\n✓ Deinen \n\n**Experten-Satz** in 3 Varianten \n\n✓\n\n**5 fertige Bio-Vorschläge**, copy-paste-ready \n\n✓\n\n**3 Pinned-Posts-Ideen** — die Schuhe in deinem Schaufenster \n\n✓\n\n**Alles als PDF** — landet in deiner Mailbox \n\nBestätige unten kurz deine E-Mail —\ndann landet der Bot-Link sofort bei dir \n\n⬇\n\nJa, ich bestätige meine E-Mail  %CONFIRMLINK%\n\nFalls der Button nicht funktioniert, kopier diesen Link in deinen Browser:\n%CONFIRMLINK% %CONFIRMLINK%\n\nGesendet an: %EMAIL%\n\nAbbestellen %UNSUBSCRIBELINK%\n\n%SENDER-INFO-SINGLELINE%",
